1
00:00:00,361 --> 00:00:01,491
(Sheldon:)I'll walk you through it.

2
00:00:01,729 --> 00:00:05,169
(Sheldon:)The game is not called
"Words With Strangers."

3
00:00:05,399 --> 00:00:08,389
No. It is not even called
"Words With Acquaintances."

4
00:00:08,602 --> 00:00:11,902
It is called "Words With..."

5
00:00:13,941 --> 00:00:17,601
(Raj:)I'm not finishing your sentence.
You pulled the plug on my funk.

6
00:00:18,312 --> 00:00:23,012
"Friends." It's "Words With Friends."
Which Stephen Hawking and I officially are.

7
00:00:23,250 --> 00:00:25,380
(Sheldon:)Now all I need is a bunk bed with a slide.

8
00:00:25,586 --> 00:00:29,316
(Sheldon:)I'll have everything I've ever wanted
since I was 6 years old.

9
00:00:29,523 --> 00:00:31,513
That's really nice. I'm happy for you.

10
00:00:31,759 --> 00:00:33,019
(Sheldon:)And I'm happy for you too.

11
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:37,200
(Sheldon:)You are now friends with someone who
is officially friends with Stephen Hawking.

12
00:00:37,431 --> 00:00:39,801
(Sheldon:)Enjoy it, boys. You may have peaked.

13
00:00:41,302 --> 00:00:43,672
(Howard:)I know Stephen Hawking. I worked with him.

14
00:00:43,838 --> 00:00:46,268
Yeah, and if they ever come out
with a game called...

15
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,770
..."Words With People You Once
Worked With," you'll be off to the races.

16
00:00:50,444 --> 00:00:52,344
(Leonard:)Sheldon, I don't think
this actually means that...

17
00:00:53,781 --> 00:00:57,051
(Sheldon:)Hold that thought.
Professor Hawking has made a move.

18
00:00:57,284 --> 00:00:58,614
(Sheldon:)Boy, oh, boy.

19
00:00:58,819 --> 00:01:01,219
(Sheldon:)It's only a matter of time
before we're coming up...

20
00:01:01,422 --> 00:01:03,682
(Sheldon:)...with fun nicknames for each other.

21
00:01:03,858 --> 00:01:08,458
I'll be Coop. Yeah. He'll be Wheels.

22
00:01:09,797 --> 00:01:11,627
(Sheldon:)If he's okay with that.

23
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:14,453
(Raj(putting game back on and removing shirt):)All right.

24
00:01:15,903 --> 00:01:18,993
(Raj(putting game back on and removing shirt):)Crank up the a.c., boys.
It's gonna get hot in here.

25
00:01:19,173 --> 00:01:22,023
Young man, young man
Get yourself off the ground

